                    {"type": "short", "stem": "Why might a result portal be hosted in the cloud rather than only on a PC in the lab?", "answer": "Students can reach it from home, it does not depend on one lab machine being switched on, and the college can add capacity during admissions without buying that capacity for the whole year."},
